    "biography": "<p><strong>Type:</strong> Smart Animal</p><p><strong>Niche:</strong> Transhuman Habitats</p><p><strong>Numbers:</strong> 1–3</p><p>Though smart cats deign to let humans pet and feed them, they are even more stubborn and independent than their baseline forebears. Nevertheless, some have been trained for surveillance and other purposes.</p><p><strong>Traits:</strong> Small Size (−10 to hit)</p><p><strong>Ware:</strong> Claws, Enhanced Hearing, Enhanced Smell, Enhanced Vision</p><p><em>Initiative printed: 6 (X-Risks uses (INT + REF) ÷ 5); Wound Threshold 3, Death Rating 23.</em></p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase X-Risks, p. 160.</em></p>",
